<!-- ================================================================
     CALIB.XML - KIEM CHUNG HE TOA DO
     Muc dich: xac nhan cong thuc doi pixel -> ath/atv la dung
     TRUOC KHI ve hang loat 800 lo.

     Cong thuc dang kiem chung:
       ath = (px / 7021 - 0.5) x 1.000000
       atv = (py / 4961 - 0.5) x 0.706595

     CACH DOC KET QUA:
     - Khung DO phai trung khit 4 canh cua anh mat bang
     - Khung XANH phai bao dung khoi lo A5 (A5-01 ... A5-23)
     Neu lech -> cong thuc sai, bao lai truoc khi ve tiep.

     Sau khi xac nhan xong: xoa dong <include url="calib.xml" />
     trong file mb-tour.xml
     ================================================================ -->

